	"fire": {
		"_readme": "Fire realism. Any fire damage source (flame tower globs, ground fire patches, Heavy flame globs) IGNITES its victim: burn_tick_damage every burn_tick_interval seconds for burn_duration seconds, REFRESHED (never stacked) on re-ignite. Ground fires never stack either: a new patch within patch_merge_radius px of a live one refreshes it instead, patch_cap is the global simultaneous ground-fire limit (oldest burns out first), and char_linger is how long the scorched ground stays after the flames die.",
