	"hive": {
		"_readme": "Permanent hive nests, seeded with the world (deterministic per run seed; ~1 site per chunks_per_hive chunks, never within min_spawn_dist px of the player start). Dormant until DAMAGED (never proximity): any hit on the hive or a satellite provokes the site for provoke_time seconds (refreshed on further damage). While provoked the hive spawns a defender squad from the maw every squad_interval s - squad_grunts grunts + (wave / squad_brute_wave_divisor) brutes, the whole squad multiplied by (1 + spore_squad_bonus per LIVING spore mound), capped at max_defenders live defenders per site; defenders never count toward wave clearing. Bile spires lob globs (glob_damage to players AND buildings within glob_radius) at the nearest target inside spire_range every spire_interval s. Killing the hive pays hive_bounty_* into the shared pool, scores hive_points, collapses the satellites and fades the creep over creep_fade s; satellites pay satellite_bounty hearts each.",
